{"version":1,"key":"card:87","content":{"id":87,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f0a06ce7-36a9-454d-a5db-7222bf4219d8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"众所周知，JavaScript 是单线程的，并且 UI  渲染和主线程使用的是同一个线程，如果在主线程中执行耗时长的计算操作，就会导致页面无法响应用户的操作，导致页面卡死。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d8c8822f-7a68-4649-b244-6c3dab4b3cff","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那对于耗时比较长的操作怎么办呢，两种思路："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"695d8aa0-cd25-41fc-9bca-33598e561566","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7d18b49a-0272-44ec-908e-03e9d446728e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9eb2f474-5bdf-4788-81bc-bbc9561d86c9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"化繁为简，是否可以将操作划分为多个部分，执行完当前部分后异步执行下一部分，使得页面可以得到渲染"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"19efb17e-c31e-495d-8a14-da71daf99e0e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"efa29e4a-ce5f-4704-9609-362c08c052c6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"requestIdleCallback"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当浏览器空闲的时候执行"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3170dd07-9f81-41b0-b5a4-2fb6119184a7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"34345f5b-c66e-4a77-886e-862a17587b69","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 Web Worker，在另一个线程执行计算操作，当计算完毕后将执行结果传递给主线程，这样就不会阻碍主线程的任何操作"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1dcbfdba-a691-4480-87ab-4fd6a65f5132","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以计算斐波那契数为例，如下函数计算斐波那契数（递归版本比较慢）"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"2ac989e6-7f26-4ba2-a129-02d7a375b398","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ea3a4ac2-d836-4b78-b71b-86d5566a734a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const fibonacci = (n) => {\n  if (n <= 0) {\n    return 0;\n  }\n  if (n === 1 || n === 2) {\n    return 1;\n  }\n  return fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2);\n}","collabId":"03dd7eeb-d2c5-4a22-872d-2f93e4b7e8b1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6a93ee18-b1e1-43c9-a7a8-e9667df3cd4b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有如下页面"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"15eb13a2-feb9-4ab0-93cb-f089463cf6de","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"44834fe4-3e58-40ac-b756-385bfb2ac64a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<div id=\"text\">Hello World</div>\n<button id=\"changeColor\">将文字变红</button>\n<button id=\"fibonacciBtn\">计算斐波那契数</button>\n<div id=\"result\"></div>","collabId":"5a7c64cb-f1ed-4f91-bbd6-d864ab1c2baa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"2481546d-19a6-4b48-ad5d-cd0d56945a83","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"98768c2f-b76b-468b-8801-28947fde95aa","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const btn = document.querySelector('#changeColor');\nbtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  const text = document.querySelector('#text');\n  text.style.color = 'red';\n});\n\n\n// 点击计算斐波那契数，耗时较久\nconst btn2 = document.querySelector('#fibonacciBtn');\nbtn2.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  const result = fibonacci(42);\n  document.querySelector('#result').innerHTML = result;\n});","collabId":"cec1c78c-2db7-4c82-9dcf-6da59772c772","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"adc9f304-b692-4351-8732-48a8a9646967","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"点击计算斐波那契数后，点击将文字变红没反应"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/w1.4zmfy9joggg0.webp","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/w1.4zmfy9joggg0.webp","width":384.54544621065645,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"948d1971-740e-4053-a574-bdcd5916f33f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"154e5c21-ba5a-4c32-93db-3f1a7c6d7cc9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们将计算的操作放在一个单独的 js 文件中，然后通过 Worker 进行加载，主线程与 Worker 线性直接通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"postMessage"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来传递消息"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"69968208-c7a2-4161-851b-8daba764f246","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Worker 线程："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"37c3466d-953a-4425-84e8-c0b69cb78dd8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"bf091707-3094-4537-ac19-41d04fcf483c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"self.addEventListener('message', (e) => {\n  const end = e.data;\n  const result = fibonacci(end);\n  self.postMessage(result);\n});","collabId":"fa1ae977-c9d0-4236-8ca8-2df730d573d4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e1a4030b-3680-4d69-8194-858f1f97a03e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"主线程："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"de1061c5-bb6b-48c5-8bac-234338b1c2ef","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c935bdc3-121a-4e2a-b8ff-71519d750e30","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"btn2.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  // 交给 worker 进行计算，不阻塞主线程\n  const worker = new Worker('worker.js');\n  worker.postMessage(42);\n  worker.addEventListener('message', (e) => {\n    const result = e.data;\n    document.querySelector('#result').innerHTML = result;\n    worker.terminate();\n  });\n});","collabId":"134bb1ab-3f96-41c1-80b0-cbb44d6a45e5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/w2.791m8zlgwos0.webp","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/w2.791m8zlgwos0.webp","width":384.54544621065645,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"eb2597bd-b200-484b-bdb8-b5c8727de814","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"6c7d4cd6-d0cf-43de-b2ba-f14c21355eb2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"db6c44d8-5b5e-49f4-b37a-0eac3b54fd1a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一些使用方法可参考阮一峰的文章"},{"type":"link","url":"","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"9c17f149-b014-4128-a5e7-2fb532f134bc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Web Worker 使用教程"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}]}],"tags":["浏览器/Web Worker"],"createTime":1689173441565,"updateTime":1775053090422,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1775053090422}}